Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社制作，仅用于日语交流使用\N请勿私自二次上传及用作商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}翻译:阿恁&雪音  校对:狗粮山  时轴:懒鬼后裔樰七  后期:冷面珺  压制:zoe  海报:狗粮山
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.13,0:00:20.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这个  请收下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.11,0:00:27.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是我圣诞节送给冬月小姐的毛毯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:32.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一点都不冷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:37.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冰室先生在一起一直都很…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:41.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不可思议地  心里会感到温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:44.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:48.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,为什么冰室先生要谢我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:54.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊  为什么呢  忍不住就脱口而出了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:58.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我才是  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:02.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,竟然在公司也在用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:10.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,果然  很暖和
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:17.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  可以来一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:19.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:27.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  是关于刚才资料的这部分…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.72,0:01:28.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:30.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐的生日快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.25,0:01:37.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:44.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的吗  讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:48.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,送对方不喜欢的首饰  是最不讨好的了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:49.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:52.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,会让人觉得明明还没交往却搞这么正式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:55.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这下就没问题了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:05.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那时候买的首饰  还没送出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:07.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真没出息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:10.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喂  冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.83,0:02:13.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这次不就是送出去的好机会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.46,0:02:16.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,展现出你粉身碎骨浑不怕的雪球精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:17.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,加油啊  冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:20.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.83,0:02:22.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,虽然我倒不想粉身碎骨…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:24.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好  努把力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.80,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1415.333,751.333)}第10话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.80,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1573.333,817.333)}暴风雨留宿大会！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:46.41,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:46.41,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰凉的距离感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:52.49,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:52.49,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些许愁绪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.19,0:02:58.50,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.19,0:02:58.50,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}与一盏盏点亮的路灯遥相呼应
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:04.35,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:04.35,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}觉察到心中一点点积攒的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:12.00,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:12.00,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是装酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.89,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.89,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像会被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:18.05,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:18.05,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,温柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:20.30,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:20.30,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,冻结一分钟 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:23.31,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:23.31,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:29.43,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:29.43,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想让你说  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:32.59,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:32.59,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,让我爱你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:35.62,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:35.62,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,说不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.87,0:03:43.61,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.87,0:03:43.61,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能说出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:08.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,新年伊始就下倾盆大雨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:10.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好没劲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,风也很大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.51,0:04:15.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.36,0:04:17.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么了  火鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么你都湿透了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:23.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因为出外勤了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:24.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和音无小姐一起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:28.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,遇上这种天气  跑业务也太惨了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和音无小姐一起就完全没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:35.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真是倒大霉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音无小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:38.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:41.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.47,0:04:43.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,湿淋淋的  还冷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:45.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,电车还停运了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:48.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  这就停运了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:49.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这下麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,坐班车估计也很挤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.15,0:04:54.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:58.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看来回家会很费劲啊  真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:01.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.95,0:05:06.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,干脆一起去车站前的商务旅馆住一晚？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:10.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这想法不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:13.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音无小姐也一起住嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:17.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嘛  也不是不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:21.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好耶  大家一起留宿啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:25.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对了  冬月小姐家的猫咪怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:27.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喂食之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:36.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有自动喂食器
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.93,0:05:40.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:42.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能让我也加入吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:47.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你这家伙  不是刚搬到离公司步行五分钟的地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不准乱入
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,话说回来  住得近真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:59.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,比起这个  今天让我在你家待一晚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.00,0:06:01.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,电车停运我回不去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:03.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:06.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冴岛先生你要怎么办  要来我家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:09.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,诶  可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:10.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真是帮大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:14.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,当然可以  来我家打游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,来吧  让我们大战一场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:23.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你很有自信吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:26.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冴岛先生也很会打吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:29.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是不会输给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好嘞  那就冲了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:32.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:37.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,生日  不知道冬月小姐有什么打算
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.53,0:06:45.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好可怕啊  打雷好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:49.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐  害怕打雷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:54.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,为什么你们两个不怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:58.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不就是声音大点吗  和烟花差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:03.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,虽然我喜欢看烟花  但我真的受不了雷声
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:10.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛小时候也很害怕打雷  但现在就不怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:12.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐一定也…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:15.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好可怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:18.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好可怕呜呜呜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:23.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好像  小时候的喵梅洛…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:27.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:33.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,从今往后  如果你害怕打雷的话就联系我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:35.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不管何时何地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:39.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我都会赶到你的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.67,0:07:42.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:43.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你是她男朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:49.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐不是有男朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:56.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐原来有恋人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:59.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明明都有我了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:04.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是  这事我也是第一次听说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.85,0:08:09.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你的男朋友难道不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:12.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,同一个部门的…冴岛先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:16.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,才不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:18.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个家伙才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:19.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:23.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可是之前你们俩一起吃饭了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.37,0:08:30.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我出外勤时不小心看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:33.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:40.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我  我们只是碰巧在休息时去了同一家想去的餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:42.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:44.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的是偶然啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:47.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你很冷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我把空调的温度调高点？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没关系  我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:55.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,话说  冰室你为什么站着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:56.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,火鸟先生  敌人来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:04.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  那音无小姐你又怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:09.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是被表白了很多次吗  被那个不死鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不死鸟…你说的是火鸟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:15.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,难道还有其他人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:19.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一天到晚老追在你屁股后面跑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:24.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他跟我不是这种关系啦  只是我关照的后辈而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:30.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你感冒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:33.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没有  我不会感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:35.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不愧是不死鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:37.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,话说  冰室你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:43.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  有点  想给冬月小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.01,0:09:48.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真可疑  赶紧给我说出真相
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:50.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你指什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:53.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你们其实已经进展不错了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:56.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这句话更适合你吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:58.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:00.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我们说嗨了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:04.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不介意  你们看起来挺开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:07.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没有这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:09.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没错没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:12.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我其实…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没谈过恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:24.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明明都是成年人了  很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:28.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不不  才没这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.95,0:10:35.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那冰室先生  算怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:44.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生发来的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:47.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你们平时也会聊天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:49.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,发来了什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:52.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  没什么大事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好像是在和他们一起玩游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嘴上说着「没什么大事」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:02.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可表情…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,却不像是没事的样子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,急死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:11.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今晚来喝个够吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:14.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音无小姐  我也喝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:16.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:22.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好了  来不来？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.55,0:11:29.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,干杯——
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.17,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fscx119\fscy160\pos(99.599,238.266)}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.17,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(138,96)}冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.17,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(138,170)}您有一条新消息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.17,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(138,135.334)}-------------
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:40.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你在干什么啊  冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:42.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是收到回复了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.05,0:11:44.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是冬月小姐吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:46.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,确实是她  但…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:49.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但你们想嘛  像这种情况
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:54.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要是我立马就「已读」了  不会显得有些恶心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,聊天不用费这么多心机的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:01.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,打工人的话  回复肯定是越快越好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:05.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喂  你们别擅自帮我已读了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:08.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什么什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:11.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,大家在喝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:15.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我们这边女子三人组超嗨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:16.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很嗨的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:18.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:20.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是天堂吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:23.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,感觉她们那边很开心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:25.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:30.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好想变成女孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:35.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你  你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:37.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:39.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,做男生就挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:46.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:50.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天终于到冬月小姐的生日了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:51.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你做好心理准备了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:54.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,粉身碎骨浑不怕呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:57.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,都说了  我不想粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:00.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是雪球精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.37,0:13:08.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐的生日…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:12.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我绝对要把那个给她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:20.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:30.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:32.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,为啥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:34.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我只是想叫住她而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:42.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行  我…太紧张了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:45.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行  不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:47.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行——
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我做的这是什么梦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,放松…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:58.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要放松  冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:04.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  今天是你的生日吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.72,0:14:05.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:09.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你怎么不早点告诉我呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:13.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,把她给问住了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:18.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,其实我想多了解了解冬月小姐啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:20.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:26.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那今晚  我们一起去吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:31.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不好意思  我今晚已经有约了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:37.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,诶  该不会是要约会吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:40.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是不是  是和我父母见面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:42.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我要带他们去吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.32,0:14:44.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.37,0:14:47.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我觉得生日是要向父母传达感谢之情的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:50.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,难得有机会和你吃顿饭  真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:52.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:54.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:15:00.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我得在冬月小姐下班之前把礼物给她才是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:04.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:05.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:07.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,过来一下可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:08.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:10.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  真是对不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:13.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,关于明天会议要用的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:16.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有份需要加急添上的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:19.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的  您说的是哪份呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:28.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:29.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:32.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,听起来像是假的  但这是真实发生的事哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:45.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  冬月…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:46.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:50.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,过来一下好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:51.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.91,0:16:01.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您好  我是冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.89,0:16:02.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:06.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的  稍后我把资料给您发过去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:08.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:14.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我怎么也找不到机会和冬月小姐说上话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:15.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:17.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这个拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:18.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:29.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不过  我今天一天都看着她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.58,0:16:34.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,发现冬月小姐  真是被职场上的大家所爱着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:39.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看到喜欢的人受欢迎  我自己都感觉很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:45.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不对  可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:52.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不能在这里败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:57.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:16:59.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:03.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好了  我正好有事想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:08.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是关于明天会议上要用的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.89,0:17:09.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:11.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这个部分…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:14.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  你说这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:15.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.57,0:17:22.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,刚才谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:23.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.09,0:17:26.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你给的意见很精准
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.05,0:17:30.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不愧是冰室先生呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:38.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:44.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:45.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:49.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天  可以一起回家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:10.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,果然冷静下来想想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:14.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,还是不送这个礼物比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:17.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天很冷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:27.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在冬月小姐看来  我最多是个关系还不错的男同事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.73,0:18:32.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这种关系  送首饰作为生日礼物会不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:37.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.99,0:18:40.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎样能让冬月小姐最感到开心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.55,0:18:45.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我完全搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:12.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:15.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,过于紧张  把附近一片都冻上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:17.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.78,0:19:22.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你好厉害呀  冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:30.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天  其实是我的生日
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:37.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我能…把这个景色  当作生日礼物收下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:40.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.91,0:19:43.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:46.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请收下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:01.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我可以打开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:24.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪花形状的耳坠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:28.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我第一眼看到  就觉得很适合冬月小姐你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:31.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,头脑一热就买下了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:33.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,想在今天送给你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.85,0:20:39.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  祝你生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:44.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是不会化的雪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,感觉就像冰室先生你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:20:58.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:02.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我戴上好看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:16.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,非常  适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.34,0:21:32.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:33.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.53,0:21:39.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生的生日礼物  你想要什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.35,0:21:42.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.25,0:21:46.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你来决定就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.98,0:21:49.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的  那就由我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.45,0:22:13.98,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.45,0:22:13.98,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}突然发觉之时  视线又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.21,0:22:29.05,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.21,0:22:29.05,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}即使遇上坏事  心也如雨后初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:42.36,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:42.36,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}你的笑容为何  如此和煦温暖春风拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:50.07,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　君のこと　何でもいいからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:50.07,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告诉我可以吗  只要是关于你什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:57.16,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,好きなこと　好きなもの　私にだけそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:57.16,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,只悄悄告诉我  你喜欢的事也好物也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.38,0:23:04.77,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　いつの日か　二人のこの距離を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.38,0:23:04.77,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告诉我可以吗  总会有一天我们的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:15.48,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,少しずつ　少しずつ　なんて少しだけ期待してる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:15.48,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,我无比期待着  它能一点一点日渐缩短
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:29.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:34.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要不要  和我一起住呢？
